cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these weights, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "Quantifying evaluation protocol bias and label-space dependence in few-shot crop mapping"
abstract: >-
  Measures what self-supervised pre-training contributes to few-shot crop mapping once
  same-split sampling and label-space size are separated from it, using a 9,472-parameter
  temporal attention encoder pre-trained on Latvian parcels and probed on Estonian ones.
authors:
